*.bmp

# Lifted output. This is a machine translation of the retail game's own code --
# a derivative work of CATZDLL.DLL and CATZ.WAD -- so it is not redistributable
# and is not shipped here. Regenerate it from your own copy of the game with
# tools/relift.py; see "Building" in README.md. work/ also holds the IDA code
# maps, the flat memory image and the generated headers, all derived from the
# same binaries.
src/
work/
analysis/*
!analysis/win16_imports.json

# Other Petz-generation games, dropped in to test how universal the toolchain
# is. Same rule as game/: not ours, not redistributable.
DOGZ*.zip
ODDBALLZ.iso
dogz/
oddballz/
